  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(1.25\\times8=10\\).\n\nAlternative method 1: Repeated doubling\n\nSince \\(8=2\\times2\\times2\\), multiplying by \\(8\\) can be done by doubling three times:\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n1.25+1.25&=2.5,\\\\\n2.5+2.5&=5,\\\\\n5+5&=10.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nThus \\(1.25\\times8=10\\), choice D.",
